  "job_B2.2.10_20251003_114500": {
    "chunk_text": "Eala, gefyrn is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0urh deofol fela \u00feinga misfor, & \u00fe\u00e6t mancynn to swy\u00f0e Gode mishyrde, & \u00fe\u00e6t Ne r\u00e6de we \u00feeah ahwar on bocum \u00fe\u00e6t man ar\u00e6rde \u00e6nig h\u00e6\u00f0engyld ahwar on worulde on eallum \u00feam Ac sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t gewear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Nembro\u00f0 & \u00f0a entas worhton \u00feone wundorlican stypel \u00e6fter Noes flode, & \u00dea sy\u00f0\u00f0an toferdon hy wide landes, & mancyn \u00fea sona swy\u00f0e weox. & \u00f0a \u00e6t nyhstan wurdon hi bep\u00e6hte \u00feurh \u00f0one ealdan deofol \u00fee Adam iu \u00e6r beswac swa \u00fe\u00e6t hi Hi namon eac him \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6t to wisdome \u00feurh deofles lare \u00fe\u00e6t hy wur\u00f0edon him for godas \u00fea sunnan & Sume men eac s\u00e6dan be \u00f0am scinendum steorrum \u00fe\u00e6t hi godas w\u00e6ron, & agunnan hy weor\u00f0ian Ac hy mihton georne tocnawan, gif hi cu\u00f0on \u00fe\u00e6t gescead, \u00fe\u00e6t se is so\u00f0 God \u00fee ealle \u00feas \u00f0ing gescop us \u00d0as gesceafta eac ealle do\u00f0 swa swa him gedihte heora agen scyppend & ne magon nan \u00feing don butan Gyt \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00feenan noldon beon gehealdene on swa feawum godum swa hy \u00e6r h\u00e6fdan, ac fengon to An man w\u00e6s on geardagum eardiende on \u00feam iglande \u00fee Creta hatte se w\u00e6s Saturnus gehaten, & se He l\u00e6fde swa\u00feeah unea\u00f0e \u00e6nne to life, \u00feeah \u00f0e he fordyde \u00fea bro\u00f0ra elles; & se w\u00e6s Iouis gehaten,",
